  "duration_s": 451.241379,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "钱学森这一生爽文编剧都不敢这么写家。人们今天讲一个爽文，男主不是我编的是真事儿。而且我负责任的告诉你，爽文编句要是敢这么写，能被读者骂死太离谱了，不符合逻辑。可钱学森这一辈子偏偏就这么离谱。一九一一年十二月十一号，上海钱学家添了个儿子，这家人什么来头？杭州前氏书香门第，父亲前，军夫是教育家。这孩子从小聪明，但您猜他迷什么火车，天天蹲在铁轨边上看火车头，看得入迷。所以后来考大学，老师劝他学这学那他谁都不听，愣是填了铁道工程，他想修铁路，让火车跑遍全中国，按按这条路走下去，他大概会成为一个优秀的铁道工程师。可一九三二年，日军的飞机在上海上空扔炸弹，他站在校园里，看着火光冲天，同胞倒下，心里那把火腾地就烧起来了。他扔下铁道工程的书说，我要学造飞机，让中国的天上也有自己的翅膀。就这一年，他自学航空之师，考上了清华的耕子赔款公费留学那年全国只招二十个人。他考上了到了美国麻省理工，他只用一年就拿下航空工程硕士，全系学霸被一道难题难住集体抗议。教授故意刁难的时候，教授门口贴除了钱学森满分大卷名字后面跟了一长串的a家人们。什么叫降维打击？这就是，但他还不满足麻省理工，偏实操，他要去搞理论，于是转投加州理工，找到了世界空气动力学泰斗。冯卡门别的学生是上门求学，钱学森是上门说，教授，我想跟您一起研究。火箭冯卡门考了几个问题，他对答如流老头子，当场破格收他做博士生。四年博士学位到手。接下来的履历，您坐稳的听不到。三十岁成了世界知名的空气动力学。专家跟导师搞出了著名的卡门。钱学森公事参与创建了后来大名鼎鼎的喷气推进实验室GPL.今天，拉萨的火星车追根溯源，还带着他的基因。二战结束后，美国派他去德国审讯v two火箭之父冯布劳恩，他拿到了美国最高级别的保密通行证。五角大楼来去自由。那会儿的美国把它当宝一样供着要钱，给钱要地位，给地位，前程似锦，荣华富贵唾手可得，换个人可能早就在好莱坞的阳光里躺平了。可钱学森呢，他回国的心一天都没变过。新中国成立的喜讯传到美国，他激动的睡不着觉，立刻开始收拾行囊。美国人急了，一批又一批人轮番来劝留下来，你要什么给什么。钱学森就一句话，我要回中国，劝不动就来硬的。一九五零年，他以回国探亲的名义准备启程行李，被扣人被扣关进拘留所，十五天出来瘦了三十斤。此后五年，软禁监视监听，全用上美国海军次长，甚至放话，他一个人抵得上五个师，我宁可毙了他，也不放他走。后来的事家，人们都知道了一封夹在家书里的求救信，绕到比利时，摆上周总理的办公桌。日内瓦谈判十一个美军飞行员换一个钱学森。一九五五年十月，他踏上罗湖桥，看到了五星红旗家人们，您把这段人生捋一遍。书香门第天才少年，弃铁从行全国公费留学碾压世界，学霸娶了名门之女。他妻子蒋英是军事家，蒋百里的女儿，家里的亲戚圈儿，还占着金庸、徐志摩这些名字。这配置。放爽文里都得被骂。作者，亲儿子，可爽文和现实的分水岭在哪？爽文的结局是功成名就，人生圆满。钱学森的结局是一穷二白的，祖国需要他他放弃一切回来了。从头开始没有办公室，他就在旧房子里上课。没有计算机，他就带着年轻亲人用。算盘算弹道。没有专家，他就自己当老师。初题出道没人及格，愣是带出了一整支队伍，然后呢东风一号两弹，结合东方红一号一样一样全搞出来。冯卡门当年送他回国时说，现在你在学术上已经超过了我。钱学森用后半辈子证明了另一件事。他不止在学术上超过了他。老师他还在选择这件事上，超过了那个时代。几乎所有人，美国人到今天都想不通，当年放着高薪，不要非要回一穷二白的祖国图什么？钱老自己早就回答过了。他说，我作为一名科技工作者，活着的目的就是为人民服务。如果人民最后对我这一生所做的工作表示满意，那才是最高的奖赏。家人们，您听听没有一句豪言壮语，没有一句漂亮话，就这么朴实的一句话，分量重的能压他秤爽文难主的故事到这儿就讲完了吗？没有他真正的故事，从他踏上祖国土地那一刻才刚刚开场。让更多孩子知道中国最该追的星长什么样。很多家长发愁，不知道给孩子看什么书，刷手机，看多了迷恋各种流量明星。其实，最该让孩子认识的是我们国家这些真正的脊梁，没有华丽的传奇，都是实实在在的奋斗与坚守。读他们的经历，教会孩子责任、勇气和家国情怀。这本国之脊梁放在左下角链接里了，大人看同样深受触动，感兴趣，直接拍收到，好好品读。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 5550,
      "text": "钱学森这一生爽文编剧都不敢这么写家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5550,
      "end_ms": 8630,
      "text": "人们今天讲一个爽文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00003",
      "start_ms": 8630,
      "end_ms": 11790,
      "text": "男主不是我编的是真事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00004",
      "start_ms": 12490,
      "end_ms": 15030,
      "text": "而且我负责任的告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00005",
      "start_ms": 15450,
      "end_ms": 17230,
      "text": "爽文编句要是敢这么写，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00006",
      "start_ms": 17470,
      "end_ms": 20230,
      "text": "能被读者骂死太离谱了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00007",
      "start_ms": 20330,
      "end_ms": 21430,
      "text": "不符合逻辑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22030,
      "end_ms": 25690,
      "text": "可钱学森这一辈子偏偏就这么离谱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00009",
      "start_ms": 26570,
      "end_ms": 28650,
      "text": "一九一一年十二月十一号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00010",
      "start_ms": 28650,
      "end_ms": 31120,
      "text": "上海钱学家添了个儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00011",
      "start_ms": 31420,
      "end_ms": 32740,
      "text": "这家人什么来头？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00012",
      "start_ms": 33160,
      "end_ms": 35620,
      "text": "杭州前氏书香门第，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00013",
      "start_ms": 36080,
      "end_ms": 36860,
      "text": "父亲前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00014",
      "start_ms": 36880,
      "end_ms": 38300,
      "text": "军夫是教育家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00015",
      "start_ms": 38460,
      "end_ms": 40280,
      "text": "这孩子从小聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00016",
      "start_ms": 40640,
      "end_ms": 43160,
      "text": "但您猜他迷什么火车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00017",
      "start_ms": 43280,
      "end_ms": 46260,
      "text": "天天蹲在铁轨边上看火车头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00018",
      "start_ms": 46700,
      "end_ms": 47520,
      "text": "看得入迷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00019",
      "start_ms": 48020,
      "end_ms": 49380,
      "text": "所以后来考大学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00020",
      "start_ms": 49760,
      "end_ms": 53260,
      "text": "老师劝他学这学那他谁都不听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00021",
      "start_ms": 53700,
      "end_ms": 55300,
      "text": "愣是填了铁道工程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00022",
      "start_ms": 55680,
      "end_ms": 56860,
      "text": "他想修铁路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00023",
      "start_ms": 57180,
      "end_ms": 59100,
      "text": "让火车跑遍全中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00024",
      "start_ms": 59100,
      "end_ms": 61520,
      "text": "按按这条路走下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00025",
      "start_ms": 61740,
      "end_ms": 65625,
      "text": "他大概会成为一个优秀的铁道工程师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00026",
      "start_ms": 66110,
      "end_ms": 67210,
      "text": "可一九三二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00027",
      "start_ms": 67510,
      "end_ms": 69775,
      "text": "日军的飞机在上海上空扔炸弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00028",
      "start_ms": 70220,
      "end_ms": 71555,
      "text": "他站在校园里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00029",
      "start_ms": 71870,
      "end_ms": 73165,
      "text": "看着火光冲天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00030",
      "start_ms": 73490,
      "end_ms": 74350,
      "text": "同胞倒下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00031",
      "start_ms": 74430,
      "end_ms": 76355,
      "text": "心里那把火腾地就烧起来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00032",
      "start_ms": 77300,
      "end_ms": 80225,
      "text": "他扔下铁道工程的书说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00033",
      "start_ms": 81260,
      "end_ms": 82635,
      "text": "我要学造飞机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00034",
      "start_ms": 83430,
      "end_ms": 87355,
      "text": "让中国的天上也有自己的翅膀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00035",
      "start_ms": 88540,
      "end_ms": 89335,
      "text": "就这一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00036",
      "start_ms": 90220,
      "end_ms": 91945,
      "text": "他自学航空之师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00037",
      "start_ms": 92330,
      "end_ms": 97615,
      "text": "考上了清华的耕子赔款公费留学那年全国只招二十个人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00038",
      "start_ms": 98020,
      "end_ms": 100555,
      "text": "他考上了到了美国麻省理工，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00039",
      "start_ms": 100880,
      "end_ms": 104405,
      "text": "他只用一年就拿下航空工程硕士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00040",
      "start_ms": 105020,
      "end_ms": 109290,
      "text": "全系学霸被一道难题难住集体抗议。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00041",
      "start_ms": 109290,
      "end_ms": 111065,
      "text": "教授故意刁难的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00042",
      "start_ms": 111420,
      "end_ms": 118355,
      "text": "教授门口贴除了钱学森满分大卷名字后面跟了一长串的a家人们。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00043",
      "start_ms": 118710,
      "end_ms": 120195,
      "text": "什么叫降维打击？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00044",
      "start_ms": 120470,
      "end_ms": 120975,
      "text": "这就是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00045",
      "start_ms": 121960,
      "end_ms": 124725,
      "text": "但他还不满足麻省理工，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00046",
      "start_ms": 125030,
      "end_ms": 125775,
      "text": "偏实操，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00047",
      "start_ms": 126110,
      "end_ms": 127075,
      "text": "他要去搞理论，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00048",
      "start_ms": 127390,
      "end_ms": 129675,
      "text": "于是转投加州理工，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00049",
      "start_ms": 130130,
      "end_ms": 132630,
      "text": "找到了世界空气动力学泰斗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00050",
      "start_ms": 132690,
      "end_ms": 136815,
      "text": "冯卡门别的学生是上门求学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00051",
      "start_ms": 137320,
      "end_ms": 138955,
      "text": "钱学森是上门说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00052",
      "start_ms": 139390,
      "end_ms": 139965,
      "text": "教授，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00053",
      "start_ms": 140310,
      "end_ms": 141970,
      "text": "我想跟您一起研究。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00054",
      "start_ms": 141970,
      "end_ms": 145095,
      "text": "火箭冯卡门考了几个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00055",
      "start_ms": 145730,
      "end_ms": 147810,
      "text": "他对答如流老头子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00056",
      "start_ms": 147810,
      "end_ms": 149870,
      "text": "当场破格收他做博士生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00057",
      "start_ms": 150090,
      "end_ms": 152245,
      "text": "四年博士学位到手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00058",
      "start_ms": 152690,
      "end_ms": 153745,
      "text": "接下来的履历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00059",
      "start_ms": 154000,
      "end_ms": 155810,
      "text": "您坐稳的听不到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00060",
      "start_ms": 155810,
      "end_ms": 159500,
      "text": "三十岁成了世界知名的空气动力学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00061",
      "start_ms": 159500,
      "end_ms": 163715,
      "text": "专家跟导师搞出了著名的卡门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00062",
      "start_ms": 164120,
      "end_ms": 172430,
      "text": "钱学森公事参与创建了后来大名鼎鼎的喷气推进实验室GPL.今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00063",
      "start_ms": 172510,
      "end_ms": 175285,
      "text": "拉萨的火星车追根溯源，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00064",
      "start_ms": 175630,
      "end_ms": 176865,
      "text": "还带着他的基因。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00065",
      "start_ms": 177610,
      "end_ms": 178805,
      "text": "二战结束后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00066",
      "start_ms": 179240,
      "end_ms": 184245,
      "text": "美国派他去德国审讯v two火箭之父冯布劳恩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00067",
      "start_ms": 184850,
      "end_ms": 188010,
      "text": "他拿到了美国最高级别的保密通行证。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00068",
      "start_ms": 188090,
      "end_ms": 190115,
      "text": "五角大楼来去自由。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00069",
      "start_ms": 190560,
      "end_ms": 194220,
      "text": "那会儿的美国把它当宝一样供着要钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00070",
      "start_ms": 194280,
      "end_ms": 195800,
      "text": "给钱要地位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00071",
      "start_ms": 195800,
      "end_ms": 196465,
      "text": "给地位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00072",
      "start_ms": 196810,
      "end_ms": 197755,
      "text": "前程似锦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00073",
      "start_ms": 198070,
      "end_ms": 200215,
      "text": "荣华富贵唾手可得，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00074",
      "start_ms": 200660,
      "end_ms": 204845,
      "text": "换个人可能早就在好莱坞的阳光里躺平了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00075",
      "start_ms": 205700,
      "end_ms": 206615,
      "text": "可钱学森呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00076",
      "start_ms": 206880,
      "end_ms": 209125,
      "text": "他回国的心一天都没变过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00077",
      "start_ms": 209810,
      "end_ms": 212050,
      "text": "新中国成立的喜讯传到美国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00078",
      "start_ms": 212250,
      "end_ms": 213555,
      "text": "他激动的睡不着觉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00079",
      "start_ms": 213950,
      "end_ms": 216015,
      "text": "立刻开始收拾行囊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00080",
      "start_ms": 216540,
      "end_ms": 217605,
      "text": "美国人急了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00081",
      "start_ms": 218110,
      "end_ms": 221975,
      "text": "一批又一批人轮番来劝留下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00082",
      "start_ms": 222260,
      "end_ms": 223440,
      "text": "你要什么给什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00083",
      "start_ms": 223500,
      "end_ms": 224985,
      "text": "钱学森就一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00084",
      "start_ms": 225310,
      "end_ms": 226290,
      "text": "我要回中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00085",
      "start_ms": 226550,
      "end_ms": 228075,
      "text": "劝不动就来硬的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00086",
      "start_ms": 229090,
      "end_ms": 230035,
      "text": "一九五零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00087",
      "start_ms": 230350,
      "end_ms": 233610,
      "text": "他以回国探亲的名义准备启程行李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00088",
      "start_ms": 233610,
      "end_ms": 236480,
      "text": "被扣人被扣关进拘留所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00089",
      "start_ms": 236480,
      "end_ms": 239085,
      "text": "十五天出来瘦了三十斤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00090",
      "start_ms": 239500,
      "end_ms": 240620,
      "text": "此后五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00091",
      "start_ms": 241080,
      "end_ms": 243585,
      "text": "软禁监视监听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00092",
      "start_ms": 244030,
      "end_ms": 246570,
      "text": "全用上美国海军次长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00093",
      "start_ms": 246590,
      "end_ms": 247270,
      "text": "甚至放话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00094",
      "start_ms": 247470,
      "end_ms": 249625,
      "text": "他一个人抵得上五个师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00095",
      "start_ms": 250020,
      "end_ms": 251375,
      "text": "我宁可毙了他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00096",
      "start_ms": 251890,
      "end_ms": 253065,
      "text": "也不放他走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00097",
      "start_ms": 254080,
      "end_ms": 255700,
      "text": "后来的事家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00098",
      "start_ms": 255700,
      "end_ms": 259890,
      "text": "人们都知道了一封夹在家书里的求救信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00099",
      "start_ms": 259990,
      "end_ms": 260945,
      "text": "绕到比利时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00100",
      "start_ms": 261340,
      "end_ms": 263025,
      "text": "摆上周总理的办公桌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00101",
      "start_ms": 263560,
      "end_ms": 268055,
      "text": "日内瓦谈判十一个美军飞行员换一个钱学森。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00102",
      "start_ms": 268970,
      "end_ms": 270315,
      "text": "一九五五年十月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00103",
      "start_ms": 270630,
      "end_ms": 271770,
      "text": "他踏上罗湖桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00104",
      "start_ms": 272070,
      "end_ms": 274575,
      "text": "看到了五星红旗家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00105",
      "start_ms": 275190,
      "end_ms": 276855,
      "text": "您把这段人生捋一遍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00106",
      "start_ms": 277350,
      "end_ms": 279695,
      "text": "书香门第天才少年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00107",
      "start_ms": 280110,
      "end_ms": 284520,
      "text": "弃铁从行全国公费留学碾压世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00108",
      "start_ms": 284520,
      "end_ms": 286625,
      "text": "学霸娶了名门之女。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00109",
      "start_ms": 287250,
      "end_ms": 289970,
      "text": "他妻子蒋英是军事家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00110",
      "start_ms": 290010,
      "end_ms": 291335,
      "text": "蒋百里的女儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00111",
      "start_ms": 292280,
      "end_ms": 293875,
      "text": "家里的亲戚圈儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00112",
      "start_ms": 294090,
      "end_ms": 297605,
      "text": "还占着金庸、徐志摩这些名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00113",
      "start_ms": 297800,
      "end_ms": 298365,
      "text": "这配置。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00114",
      "start_ms": 299440,
      "end_ms": 301500,
      "text": "放爽文里都得被骂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00115",
      "start_ms": 302480,
      "end_ms": 302960,
      "text": "作者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00116",
      "start_ms": 302960,
      "end_ms": 303720,
      "text": "亲儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00117",
      "start_ms": 304520,
      "end_ms": 307080,
      "text": "可爽文和现实的分水岭在哪？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00118",
      "start_ms": 308060,
      "end_ms": 310600,
      "text": "爽文的结局是功成名就，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00119",
      "start_ms": 311500,
      "end_ms": 312580,
      "text": "人生圆满。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00120",
      "start_ms": 314060,
      "end_ms": 317680,
      "text": "钱学森的结局是一穷二白的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00121",
      "start_ms": 317680,
      "end_ms": 321440,
      "text": "祖国需要他他放弃一切回来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00122",
      "start_ms": 321660,
      "end_ms": 324000,
      "text": "从头开始没有办公室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00123",
      "start_ms": 324380,
      "end_ms": 326160,
      "text": "他就在旧房子里上课。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00124",
      "start_ms": 326580,
      "end_ms": 327660,
      "text": "没有计算机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00125",
      "start_ms": 328120,
      "end_ms": 330090,
      "text": "他就带着年轻亲人用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00126",
      "start_ms": 330130,
      "end_ms": 331330,
      "text": "算盘算弹道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00127",
      "start_ms": 331950,
      "end_ms": 332770,
      "text": "没有专家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00128",
      "start_ms": 332970,
      "end_ms": 334510,
      "text": "他就自己当老师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00129",
      "start_ms": 334850,
      "end_ms": 336430,
      "text": "初题出道没人及格，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00130",
      "start_ms": 336730,
      "end_ms": 338930,
      "text": "愣是带出了一整支队伍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00131",
      "start_ms": 339050,
      "end_ms": 341570,
      "text": "然后呢东风一号两弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00132",
      "start_ms": 341650,
      "end_ms": 345690,
      "text": "结合东方红一号一样一样全搞出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00133",
      "start_ms": 346170,
      "end_ms": 348510,
      "text": "冯卡门当年送他回国时说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00134",
      "start_ms": 348850,
      "end_ms": 352050,
      "text": "现在你在学术上已经超过了我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00135",
      "start_ms": 352550,
      "end_ms": 355690,
      "text": "钱学森用后半辈子证明了另一件事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00136",
      "start_ms": 356110,
      "end_ms": 358090,
      "text": "他不止在学术上超过了他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00137",
      "start_ms": 358090,
      "end_ms": 360890,
      "text": "老师他还在选择这件事上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00138",
      "start_ms": 361090,
      "end_ms": 362370,
      "text": "超过了那个时代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00139",
      "start_ms": 362510,
      "end_ms": 363575,
      "text": "几乎所有人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00140",
      "start_ms": 364270,
      "end_ms": 366145,
      "text": "美国人到今天都想不通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00141",
      "start_ms": 366600,
      "end_ms": 367980,
      "text": "当年放着高薪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00142",
      "start_ms": 368080,
      "end_ms": 371580,
      "text": "不要非要回一穷二白的祖国图什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00143",
      "start_ms": 371760,
      "end_ms": 373775,
      "text": "钱老自己早就回答过了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00144",
      "start_ms": 374680,
      "end_ms": 375185,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00145",
      "start_ms": 376310,
      "end_ms": 378495,
      "text": "我作为一名科技工作者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00146",
      "start_ms": 379290,
      "end_ms": 381805,
      "text": "活着的目的就是为人民服务。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00147",
      "start_ms": 382840,
      "end_ms": 386875,
      "text": "如果人民最后对我这一生所做的工作表示满意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00148",
      "start_ms": 387340,
      "end_ms": 389005,
      "text": "那才是最高的奖赏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00149",
      "start_ms": 389980,
      "end_ms": 390580,
      "text": "家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00150",
      "start_ms": 390660,
      "end_ms": 394065,
      "text": "您听听没有一句豪言壮语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00151",
      "start_ms": 394360,
      "end_ms": 395955,
      "text": "没有一句漂亮话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00152",
      "start_ms": 396810,
      "end_ms": 398695,
      "text": "就这么朴实的一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00153",
      "start_ms": 399190,
      "end_ms": 404925,
      "text": "分量重的能压他秤爽文难主的故事到这儿就讲完了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00154",
      "start_ms": 405390,
      "end_ms": 407255,
      "text": "没有他真正的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00155",
      "start_ms": 407590,
      "end_ms": 411450,
      "text": "从他踏上祖国土地那一刻才刚刚开场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00156",
      "start_ms": 411630,
      "end_ms": 416145,
      "text": "让更多孩子知道中国最该追的星长什么样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00157",
      "start_ms": 416600,
      "end_ms": 418235,
      "text": "很多家长发愁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00158",
      "start_ms": 418610,
      "end_ms": 420455,
      "text": "不知道给孩子看什么书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00159",
      "start_ms": 421020,
      "end_ms": 421600,
      "text": "刷手机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00160",
      "start_ms": 421600,
      "end_ms": 424565,
      "text": "看多了迷恋各种流量明星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00161",
      "start_ms": 425220,
      "end_ms": 425640,
      "text": "其实，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00162",
      "start_ms": 425640,
      "end_ms": 430185,
      "text": "最该让孩子认识的是我们国家这些真正的脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00163",
      "start_ms": 431130,
      "end_ms": 432745,
      "text": "没有华丽的传奇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00164",
      "start_ms": 433190,
      "end_ms": 436375,
      "text": "都是实实在在的奋斗与坚守。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00165",
      "start_ms": 437220,
      "end_ms": 438455,
      "text": "读他们的经历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00166",
      "start_ms": 438830,
      "end_ms": 442465,
      "text": "教会孩子责任、勇气和家国情怀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00167",
      "start_ms": 442920,
      "end_ms": 446160,
      "text": "这本国之脊梁放在左下角链接里了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00168",
      "start_ms": 446160,
      "end_ms": 448200,
      "text": "大人看同样深受触动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00169",
      "start_ms": 448220,
      "end_ms": 448860,
      "text": "感兴趣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00170",
      "start_ms": 448920,
      "end_ms": 450300,
      "text": "直接拍收到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38eb65b8de747391_s00171",
      "start_ms": 450300,
      "end_ms": 451075,
      "text": "好好品读。"
    }
  ],
